) (&lt;a href="Hanzi%20sederhana"&gt;Hanzi sederhana&lt;/a&gt;: 华侨银行有限公司; &lt;a href="pinyin"&gt;pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: Huáqiáo Yínháng Yǒuxìan Gōngsī), kacekak minangka jeneng OCBC Bank (华侨银行),ya iku organisasi &lt;a href="jasa%20kauangan"&gt;jasa kauangan&lt;/a&gt; publisitas kang duwé &lt;a href="kantor%20punjer"&gt;kantor punjer&lt;/a&gt; ana ing &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, madeg ing &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt; amarga &lt;a href="Depresi%20Besar"&gt;Depresi Besar&lt;/a&gt; banjur digabungake déning telu bank-bank antarané &lt;a href="Chinese%20Commercial%20Bank"&gt;Chinese Commercial Bank&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Ho%20Hong%20Bank"&gt;Ho Hong Bank&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1917"&gt;1917&lt;/a&gt;) lan Oversea-Chinese Bank (&lt;a href="1919"&gt;1919&lt;/a&gt;). OCBC Bank dadi salah sijiné bank lokal paling misuwur ing Singapura, minangka aset golongan punjul S$224.000.000.000. Bank kang duwé rangking kredit paling dhuwur wewengkon ing Singapura. Sasi &lt;a href="November"&gt;November&lt;/a&gt; 2010, OCBC OCBC Bank kagolong banj lokal gedhé dhéwé ana ing &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt; déning kapitalisasi pasar. Asebab kaanan global, bank &lt;a href="OCBC%20NISP"&gt;OCBC&lt;/a&gt; kagolong bank lokal paling cilik ing Singapura.
Jaringan global bank kang misuwur lan maju ndadèkaké duwé anak cabang punjul &lt;a href="530"&gt;530&lt;/a&gt; cabang lan duwé kantor pawakilan ing &lt;a href="15"&gt;15&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="nagara"&gt;nagara&lt;/a&gt; lan wewengkon, ya iku salah sijiné Singapura, &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, lan cabang ing negera &lt;a href="Republik%20Rakyat%20Cina"&gt;Republik Rakyat Cina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karajan%20Manunggal"&gt;Karajan Manunggal&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sarekat"&gt;Amérika Sarekat&lt;/a&gt;. Cabang-cabang bank OCBC dumadi dumadi &lt;a href="411"&gt;411&lt;/a&gt; cabang lan kantor ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; dioperasikake déning anak parusahaané, &lt;a href="Bank%20OCBC%20NISP"&gt;Bank OCBC NISP&lt;/a&gt;.
