<doc id="104972" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=104972" title="Soimah Pancawati">
Soimah Pancawati

Soimah Pancawati (#ALIH) ya iku sawijining seniman asal &lt;a href="Yogyakarta"&gt;Yogyakarta&lt;/a&gt; kang duwé kaprigelan kang akèh. Ora mung prigel ing bab &lt;a href="kesenian"&gt;kesenian&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Jawa"&gt;Jawa&lt;/a&gt;, Soimah Pancawati uga sawijining repper. Panjenengane wis uga asring nyanyi &lt;a href="campursari"&gt;campursari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="sinden"&gt;sinden&lt;/a&gt;, mèlu dadi paraga &lt;a href="kethoprak"&gt;kethoprak&lt;/a&gt;, pop Jawa, &lt;a href="Hip%20hop"&gt;Hip hop&lt;/a&gt;, paraga dagelan, lan &lt;a href="panatacara"&gt;panatacara&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier</h2>
Karier.
Wiwitane, Soimah Pancawati tumut komunitas seni ing Yogyakarta, kaya ta &lt;a href="kethoprak"&gt;kethoprak&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jogja%20Hip%20Hop%20Foundation"&gt;Jogja Hip Hop Foundation&lt;/a&gt;. Lumantar Jogja Hip Hop Foundation, Soimah Pancawati nindakaké pamentasan mubeng donya kang sepisanan. Soimah bebarengan Jogja Hip Hop Foundation pentas ing Asia Society, 725 Park Avenue, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; lan éntuk apresiasi. Taun 2012, ing sasi &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt;, Jogja Hip Hop Foundation tur ing Amérika mubeng 10 kutha nanging Soimah Pancawati ora bisa mèlu jalaran wis duwé kontrak kanggo @Show_Imah ing stasiun televisi &lt;a href="Trans%20TV"&gt;Trans TV&lt;/a&gt;.
Saiki, Soimah Pancawati dadi pelawak ing acara, &lt;a href="Yuk%20Keep%20Smile"&gt;Yuk Keep Smile&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Comedy%20Project"&gt;Comedy Project&lt;/a&gt;, lan dadi panatacara &lt;a href="%40Show%20Imah"&gt;@Show Imah&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Trans%20TV"&gt;Trans TV&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké tau dadi presenter acara Segerrr, Sedap Malam, ing stasiun TV &lt;a href="Antv"&gt;Antv&lt;/a&gt;.
