Robert von Heine Geldern ya iku &lt;a href="ahli"&gt;ahli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="prasajarah"&gt;prasajarah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="arkeolog"&gt;arkeolog&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="etnolog"&gt;etnolog&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Wina"&gt;Wina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ostenrik"&gt;Ostenrik&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="guru%20besar"&gt;guru besar&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Iranian%20Institute"&gt;Iranian Institute&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="School%20for%20Asiatic%20Studies"&gt;School for Asiatic Studies&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York"&gt;New York&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké lair &lt;a href="tanggal"&gt;tanggal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juli"&gt;Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="taun"&gt;taun&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="18585"&gt;18585&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Grub"&gt;Grub&lt;/a&gt;, Ostenrik lan tilar donya ing &lt;a href="Vienna"&gt;Vienna&lt;/a&gt; tanggal &lt;a href="26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1968"&gt;1968&lt;/a&gt;.
Geldern ya iku wong kang mapanake &lt;a href="dhasar"&gt;dhasar&lt;/a&gt;-dhasar prasajarah &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; bebarengan karo &lt;a href="Von%20Stein%20Callenfels"&gt;Von Stein Callenfels&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;a href="Karya"&gt;Karya&lt;/a&gt;-karyané kang wis digawé ing antarané Urheimat und fruheste Wanderungen des Austronesier (Anthropos XXVII, &lt;a href="1932"&gt;1932&lt;/a&gt;) lan Prehistoric research in the Netherlands Indiessajeroning: Science and Scientists in the Netherlands Indies (New York, &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt;), The Archaeology and Art of Sumatra, sajeroning E. M. Loeb, Sumatra, Its History and People (&lt;a href="Vienna"&gt;Vienna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1935"&gt;1935&lt;/a&gt;), Some Problems of Migration in the Pacific sajeroning Kultur und Sprache (diedit olèh &lt;a href="W.%20Koppers"&gt;W. Koppers&lt;/a&gt;, Vienna, &lt;a href="1952"&gt;1952&lt;/a&gt;), Research on Southeast Asia: Problems and Suggestions sajeroning American Anthropologist (&lt;a href="April"&gt;April&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1946"&gt;1946&lt;/a&gt;).
Dhèwèké ngusulake sapérangan &lt;a href="t%C3%A9yori"&gt;téyori&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="kontroversial"&gt;kontroversial&lt;/a&gt; nanging biniji narik, kalebu yèn &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="tenggara"&gt;tenggara&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="Yunnan"&gt;Yunnan&lt;/a&gt;) ya iku protohomeland wong Indonésia, yèn bentuk-&lt;a href="bentuk"&gt;bentuk&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="budaya"&gt;budaya&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indian"&gt;Indian&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="seni"&gt;seni&lt;/a&gt;ne ditampa déning &lt;a href="masarakat"&gt;masarakat&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indocina"&gt;Indocina&lt;/a&gt; lumantar deriwat (&lt;a href="keturunan"&gt;keturunan&lt;/a&gt;) Indonésia, ya iku telung jinis &lt;a href="kapak%20batu"&gt;kapak batu&lt;/a&gt; kang minangka panemtu utama saka budaya &lt;a href="ark%C3%A9ologi"&gt;arkéologi&lt;/a&gt; sarta tingkat &lt;a href="etnologis"&gt;etnologis&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Asia%20tenggara"&gt;Asia tenggara&lt;/a&gt;.
