Kang Youwei

Kang Youwei (&lt;a href="Hanzi%20Sederhana"&gt;Hanzi Sederhana&lt;/a&gt;: 康有为; &lt;a href="Hanzi%20Tradisional"&gt;Hanzi Tradisional&lt;/a&gt;: 康有為; &lt;a href="Pinyin"&gt;Pinyin&lt;/a&gt;: Kāng Yǒuwéi; Wade–Giles: K'ang Yu-wei; 19Maret 185831Maret 1927), ya iku sawijining wong sujana asal Tiongkok, kang misuwur kanthi &lt;a href="kaligrafi%20Tiongkok"&gt;kaligrafer&lt;/a&gt; lan pemikir pulitik berprabawa lan &lt;a href="gerakan%20reformasi"&gt;reformator&lt;/a&gt; ing pungkasan &lt;a href="dinasti%20Qing"&gt;dinasti Qing&lt;/a&gt;.
